#### Section 3 — Features Grid

> Goal: Answer "why should I use this?" with 6 scannable cards.
> 

```
┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐
│ 📋 Copy & Paste│ │ 🌙 Dark Mode  │ │ ♿ Accessible │
│ No install   │ │ Every comp   │ │ WAI-ARIA     │
└──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘
┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐
│ 🔷 TypeScript │ │ 🎨 Themeable  │ │ ⚡ Lightweight│
│ Full types   │ │ CSS vars     │ │ Zero runtime │
└──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘
```

```tsx
// src/components/landing/Features.tsx
const features = [
  { icon: Clipboard, title: "Copy & Paste",  desc: "No npm install. Just copy the code." },
  { icon: Moon,      title: "Dark Mode",     desc: "Built-in dark mode on every component." },
  { icon: Shield,    title: "Accessible",    desc: "WAI-ARIA compliant out of the box." },
  { icon: FileCode,  title: "TypeScript",    desc: "Full type safety and IntelliSense." },
  { icon: Paintbrush,title: "Customizable",  desc: "CSS variables for easy theming." },
  { icon: Zap,       title: "Lightweight",   desc: "Zero runtime, just Tailwind classes." },
];

export default function Features() {
  return (
    <section className="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 className="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Why ideasUI?</h2>
      <div className="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {features.map(({ icon: Icon, title, desc }) => (
          <div key={title} className="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition">
            <Icon className="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mb-3" />
            <h3 className="font-semibold text-white mb-1">{title}</h3>
            <p className="text-sm text-zinc-400">{desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}
```

