### 11.3 Engaging Content Strategy

#### Content Principles

| Principle | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Lead with outcome | "Build beautiful UIs" not "A component library" |
| Developer language | Use terms devs know: copy-paste, WAI-ARIA, CSS vars, zero deps |
| Show don't tell | Live previews beat feature bullet lists |
| Scannable | Short sentences, icons, bold key words |
| Action-oriented | Every section ends with a CTA or next step |

#### Hero Copy — Variants to Test

```
Option A (outcome-first):
  "Build beautiful UIs with copy-paste components"
  "Accessible, customizable, open-source React components built with Tailwind CSS."

Option B (pain-point):
  "Stop fighting your component library"
  "ideasUI gives you production-ready components you actually own."

Option C (speed):
  "Ship faster with ready-made React components"
  "Copy. Paste. Done. No config, no lock-in, no runtime overhead."
```

#### Features Section — Engaging Card Copy

```
❌ Weak:   "Dark mode support"
✅ Strong: "Dark mode on every component — zero extra config"

❌ Weak:   "TypeScript"
✅ Strong: "Full TypeScript — IntelliSense works out of the box"

❌ Weak:   "Accessible"
✅ Strong: "WAI-ARIA compliant — production-ready accessibility, free"

❌ Weak:   "Customizable"
✅ Strong: "CSS variables — change your entire theme in 10 lines"
```

#### Showcase Section — Engaging Labels

```tsx
// Add context labels above each preview — tells the story
<div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
  <span className="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400" /> {/* live indicator */}
  <span className="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono">Live Preview</span>
</div>
```

#### Empty States & Loading

```tsx
// Skeleton loader for component previews — keeps page feeling alive
<div className="animate-pulse space-y-3">
  <div className="h-10 bg-zinc-800 rounded-lg w-32" />
  <div className="h-4 bg-zinc-800 rounded w-48" />
</div>
```

---

### 11.4 Full Screen Responsiveness

#### Breakpoint Strategy

```
Mobile:   < 640px   (sm)  — single column, stacked layout
Tablet:   640–1024px (md) — 2 columns, condensed nav
Desktop:  > 1024px  (lg)  — full layout, sidebar visible
Wide:     > 1280px  (xl)  — max-width containers centered
```

#### Responsive Navbar

```tsx
<nav className="sticky top-0 z-50 h-16 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md">
  <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-full flex items-center justify-between">
    <Logo />

    {/* Desktop nav links — hidden on mobile */}
    <div className="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <Link href="/docs">Docs</Link>
      <Link href="/components">Components</Link>
      <Link href="/examples">Examples</Link>
    </div>

    <div className="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
      <SearchTrigger />
      <GitHubStars className="hidden sm:flex" />
      <ThemeToggle />
      {/* Mobile hamburger — visible only on mobile */}
      <MobileMenuButton className="md:hidden" />
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

{/* Mobile slide-down menu */}
<MobileMenu links={["Docs", "Components", "Examples", "GitHub"]} />
```

#### Responsive Hero

```tsx
<section className="relative py-20 sm:py-28 md:py-40 text-center px-4">
  <h1 className="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
    Build beautiful UIs<br />
    <span className="text-violet-400">with copy-paste components</span>
  </h1>

  <p className="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-sm sm:max-w-xl mx-auto">
    Accessible, customizable, open-source React components built with Tailwind CSS.
  </p>

  {/* Stack CTAs vertically on mobile, horizontal on sm+ */}
  <div className="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center items-center">
    <Link href="/docs" className="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium">
      Get Started
    </Link>
    <Link href="/components" className="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-zinc-700 text-sm text-zinc-300">
      Browse Components
    </Link>
  </div>
</section>
```

#### Responsive Features Grid

```tsx
{/* 1 col mobile → 2 col tablet → 3 col desktop */}
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
  {features.map(({ icon: Icon, title, desc }) => (
    <div key={title} className="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50">
      <Icon className="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mb-3" />
      <h3 className="font-semibold text-white mb-1">{title}</h3>
      <p className="text-sm text-zinc-400">{desc}</p>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
```

#### Responsive Showcase Grid

```tsx
{/* 1 col mobile → 2 col desktop */}
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
  {showcaseComponents.map((slug) => (
    <ComponentPreview key={slug} slug={slug} />
  ))}
</div>
```

#### Responsive Stats Bar

```tsx
{/* 2 col mobile → 4 col desktop */}
<div className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8 text-center">
  {stats.map(({ value, label }) => (
    <div key={label}>
      <div className="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white">{value}</div>
      <div className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">{label}</div>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
```

#### Responsive Testimonials

```tsx
{/* 1 col mobile → 3 col desktop */}
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
```

#### Responsive Typography Scale

| Screen | Hero H1 | Section H2 | Body |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Mobile `< 640px` | `text-4xl` | `text-2xl` | `text-sm` |
| Tablet `640px+` | `text-5xl` | `text-3xl` | `text-base` |
| Desktop `1024px+` | `text-6xl` | `text-3xl` | `text-base` |
| Wide `1280px+` | `text-7xl` | `text-4xl` | `text-base` |

#### Touch & Mobile UX Rules

```
✅ Tap targets minimum 44×44px (buttons, links)
✅ No hover-only interactions — all hover states have tap equivalents
✅ Install command pill scrolls horizontally on small screens (overflow-x-auto)
✅ Code blocks scroll horizontally, never wrap
✅ Modal/search dialog fills screen on mobile (w-full, rounded-none on sm)
✅ Sidebar collapses to bottom sheet or hamburger on mobile
✅ Font size never below 14px on mobile
✅ Line length max 65–75 chars on all screens (max-w-prose or max-w-xl)
```

#### Mobile Search Dialog

```tsx
// Full screen on mobile, centered modal on desktop
<div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-end sm:items-start sm:justify-center sm:pt-[20vh]
  bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
  <div className="w-full sm:max-w-lg rounded-t-2xl sm:rounded-xl
    bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
    {/* search input */}
  </div>
</div>
```

