---

Color System — Theme Variables & Primitives

> **Rule:** Never use raw hex values or hardcoded Tailwind color classes like `bg-zinc-900` or `text-violet-400` directly in components. Always use semantic CSS variable tokens mapped through Tailwind. This ensures dark/light mode works automatically everywhere.
CSS Variable Primitives (`globals.css`) (`colors.ts`)
> 

